    "briefing": "Welcome to the world championships ice hockey!\n\nThe objective of this mission is that you shoot\nthe \"puck\" in the opponents goal.\n\nSince you will have to hit your opponent quite\noften it is required that you play this game\nin god mode, start the game with:\n\ntank -god -loadsofweapons\n\nAlso I suggest you play the game in high\nresolution mode."
